# Powerful Broker targeting a player with a single kind of counter: Galvanic Discharge gives Bot1 three energy counters and Bot1 pays two
# of them for 2 damage to Bot2's Grizzly Bears, leaving exactly one. The Broker then gives it one more (2 energy): not a poison or an
# experience counter, which it has none of.

[Bot1 Deck]
Gleemox
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Powerful Broker
Galvanic Discharge
Forest
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Grizzly Bears
Forest
Forest x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Gleemox.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Gleemox.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Powerful Broker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Gleemox.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Galvanic Discharge.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Decline
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Energy = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Powerful Broker.Activate(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Energy = 2
Bot1.Poison = 0
Bot1.Experience = (absent)
Bot2.Graveyard = Grizzly Bears
